{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.ParticleInteractions.demand_stability","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.demand_stability","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic"],"declarations":14,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.demand_stability","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.demand_stability","kind":"theorem","line":60,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/demand_stability.lean#L60-L76","doc":"**Proposition statement** (from manuscript):\n\nThe derived atom $\\mathcal{A}(Z, N)$ is:*\n\n1.\n\nThe Lean encoding below states the manuscript claim conditional on the `PeriodicTableDemandConjecture` hypothesis class. It derives the required inequalities by extracting them from the hypothesis. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:demand-stability","label":"prop:demand-stability","md":"quantum-observable-universe/nuclear-interactions/demand-stability.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.PeriodicTableDemandConjecture.is_doubly_magic","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.PeriodicTableDemandConjecture.is_doubly_magic","kind":"theorem","line":53,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/demand_stability.lean#L53-L53","doc":"Doubly magic: the atom is a local minimum of `tr_M` among neighbours. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.PeriodicTableDemandConjecture.is_shell_closed","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.PeriodicTableDemandConjecture.is_shell_closed","kind":"theorem","line":51,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/demand_stability.lean#L51-L51","doc":"Shell-closed: noble-gas-like atom has empty demand. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.PeriodicTableDemandConjecture.is_beta_stable","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.PeriodicTableDemandConjecture.is_beta_stable","kind":"theorem","line":47,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/demand_stability.lean#L47-L47","doc":"Beta stability: for every single-nucleon exchange at fixed `A = Z + N`,\n`|dem(Z, N)|` is the minimum among neighbouring `(Z ± 1, N ∓ 1)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.PeriodicTableDemandConjecture.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.PeriodicTableDemandConjecture.mk","kind":"ctor","line":44,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/demand_stability.lean#L44-L44","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.PeriodicTableDemandConjecture","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.PeriodicTableDemandConjecture","kind":"class","line":42,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/demand_stability.lean#L42-L57","doc":"The physical hypotheses carried by the Periodic Table Demand Conjecture.\n(Carried as quantified hypotheses, not directly as conclusion fields). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.DemandStabilityContext.trM","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.DemandStabilityContext.trM","kind":"def","line":40,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Particl